            "review_title": "Review at Smoothies & Juices",
            "review_text": "Chi T\n39 contributions\n0\nBest nice view at HoanKiem Lake,Hanoi\nAug 2017 • Friends\nSmoothies & Juices is the best view to see Hoan Kiem lake in Hanoi, as well as attractive drinks menu, more than 200 kinds of drinks, delicious desserts, good for health, beautiful decoration. Elegant, modern, looking full of Hoankiem lake from the 3rd floor. Friendly staff, cute, enthusiastic. You can go to address 19-21 Dinh Tien Hoang street, then take the elevator to the 3rd floor.\nRead more\nWritten August 27, 2017",
